{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/Elastic Beanstalk에 애플리케이션 배포, 자동화(CD)/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"3aa5f43b-2e5f-5042-a259-dbac2763aea9","excerpt":"이전 기록에서 ECR에 Spring Boot application 이미지 push를 자동화하는 것까지 진행했다.\n이젠 이미지를 Elastic Beanstalk에 반영하는 작업을 자동화할 차례다. 먼저 Elastic Beanstalk를 실행해보자.\nElastic Beanstalk는 AWS 콘솔에서 간단한 설정만으로 이전에 봤던 아래 모든 인프라 아키텍처를 …","html":"<p>이전 기록에서 ECR에 Spring Boot application 이미지 push를 자동화하는 것까지 진행했다.\n이젠 이미지를 Elastic Beanstalk에 반영하는 작업을 자동화할 차례다.</p>\n<p>먼저 Elastic Beanstalk를 실행해보자.\nElastic Beanstalk는 AWS 콘솔에서 간단한 설정만으로 이전에 봤던 아래 모든 인프라 아키텍처를 구성할 수 있다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/1b89ca8bd52a8476fc04d7b4a10c5224/526f1/architecture.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 66.47058823529413%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='architecture' title='' src='/static/1b89ca8bd52a8476fc04d7b4a10c5224/ca1dc/architecture.png' srcset='/static/1b89ca8bd52a8476fc04d7b4a10c5224/e7570/architecture.png 170w,\n/static/1b89ca8bd52a8476fc04d7b4a10c5224/f46e7/architecture.png 340w,\n/static/1b89ca8bd52a8476fc04d7b4a10c5224/ca1dc/architecture.png 680w,\n/static/1b89ca8bd52a8476fc04d7b4a10c5224/02d09/architecture.png 1020w,\n/static/1b89ca8bd52a8476fc04d7b4a10c5224/9d567/architecture.png 1360w,\n/static/1b89ca8bd52a8476fc04d7b4a10c5224/526f1/architecture.png 1702w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Docker 이미지를 활용할 것이기 때문에 Elastic Beanstalk 플랫폼은 Docker를 선택한다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/670cf724c7a2ccd7b0c6caccd0084a75/fe70a/platform.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 54.70588235294118%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='platform' title='' src='/static/670cf724c7a2ccd7b0c6caccd0084a75/ca1dc/platform.png' srcset='/static/670cf724c7a2ccd7b0c6caccd0084a75/e7570/platform.png 170w,\n/static/670cf724c7a2ccd7b0c6caccd0084a75/f46e7/platform.png 340w,\n/static/670cf724c7a2ccd7b0c6caccd0084a75/ca1dc/platform.png 680w,\n/static/670cf724c7a2ccd7b0c6caccd0084a75/02d09/platform.png 1020w,\n/static/670cf724c7a2ccd7b0c6caccd0084a75/fe70a/platform.png 1122w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n다른 환경 구성은 본인에 프로젝트에 맞게 설정한 후 환경을 생성하면, 샘플 앱이 정상적으로 실행되는 것을 확인할 수 있다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/af14d99add3f7aed619bffd22e89bbf1/a12f4/sample-app.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 40.588235294117645%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='sample app' title='' src='/static/af14d99add3f7aed619bffd22e89bbf1/ca1dc/sample-app.png' srcset='/static/af14d99add3f7aed619bffd22e89bbf1/e7570/sample-app.png 170w,\n/static/af14d99add3f7aed619bffd22e89bbf1/f46e7/sample-app.png 340w,\n/static/af14d99add3f7aed619bffd22e89bbf1/ca1dc/sample-app.png 680w,\n/static/af14d99add3f7aed619bffd22e89bbf1/02d09/sample-app.png 1020w,\n/static/af14d99add3f7aed619bffd22e89bbf1/9d567/sample-app.png 1360w,\n/static/af14d99add3f7aed619bffd22e89bbf1/a12f4/sample-app.png 2194w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h2 id=\"이슈\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9D%B4%EC%8A%88\" aria-label=\"이슈 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>이슈</h2>\n<p>환경이 생성될 때 겪은 이슈들은 다음과 같다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"vpc-지정\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#vpc-%EC%A7%80%EC%A0%95\" aria-label=\"vpc 지정 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>vpc 지정</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Auto Scaling activity failed XX minutes ago with error: The parameter SecurityGroup is not recognized. Launching EC2 instance failed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Auto Scaling 그룹이 인스턴스를 생성하는 과정에서 보안 그룹을 제대로 식별하지 못하는 문제가 발생했다.\n<a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/77394170/elastic-beanstalk-auto-scaling-activity-failed-with-error-the-parameter-securi\">Stack Overflow</a>를 참고해 <strong>VPC를 명시적으로 선택</strong>하여 문제를 바로 해결할 수 있었다.\nAWS의 <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/ts-as-instancelaunchfailure.html\">Troubleshoot EC2 Auto Scailing</a> 에도 위 오류가 없어서 정확한 이유는 아직 확인하지 못했다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"public-ip\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#public-ip\" aria-label=\"public ip permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>public ip</h3>\n<p>EC2 인스턴스를 public subnet에 생성하고, <strong>public ip를 허용</strong>해줘야 인스턴스가 Elastic Beanstalk과 연결될 수 있다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"EC2-권한\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#EC2-%EA%B6%8C%ED%95%9C\" aria-label=\"EC2 권한 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>EC2 권한</h3>\n<p>EC2가 <strong>ECR의 이미지를 pull</strong>할 수 있어야 하기 때문에 EC2의 role에 <code class=\"language-text\">AmazonEC2ContainerRegistryReadOnly</code> 권한을 줘야 했다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"RDS-연결\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#RDS-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0\" aria-label=\"RDS 연결 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>RDS 연결</h2>\n<p>Elastic Beanstalk에서 RDS를 같은 VPC 내에 생성해주는 것은 맞지만, Spring Boot Application이 RDS와 연결되기 위해선 추가로 해줘야 하는 것들이 있다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"환경-변수\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD-%EB%B3%80%EC%88%98\" aria-label=\"환경 변수 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>환경 변수</h3>\n<p>애플리케이션이 처음 실행될 때 데이터베이스 연결 정보를 설정해야 하므로 Elastic Beanstalk 환경의 구성(Configuration) 탭에서 <strong>환경 변수(Environment Variables)</strong>를 지정해야 한다. 생성된 RDS 정보를 기반으로 적절한 값을 입력한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">jdbc:mysql://[RDS 엔드포인트]:[포트]/[데이터베이스명]</code></pre></div>\n<p>DB_URL은 위와 같은 형식으로 작성하면 되고, USERNAME과 PASSWORD는 Elastic Beanstalk 환경을 생성할 때 지정한 값을 작성하면 된다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/b95107053d5945259558afb0d85fa44b/f0faf/env.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 51.17647058823529%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='env' title='' src='/static/b95107053d5945259558afb0d85fa44b/ca1dc/env.png' srcset='/static/b95107053d5945259558afb0d85fa44b/e7570/env.png 170w,\n/static/b95107053d5945259558afb0d85fa44b/f46e7/env.png 340w,\n/static/b95107053d5945259558afb0d85fa44b/ca1dc/env.png 680w,\n/static/b95107053d5945259558afb0d85fa44b/02d09/env.png 1020w,\n/static/b95107053d5945259558afb0d85fa44b/9d567/env.png 1360w,\n/static/b95107053d5945259558afb0d85fa44b/f0faf/env.png 1644w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"rds-연결-확인\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#rds-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8\" aria-label=\"rds 연결 확인 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>rds 연결 확인</h3>\n<p>EC2 인스턴스에 SSH로 접속한 뒤, RDS에 정상적으로 연결되는지 확인한다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/abbf900364aa2578b7c0669800556ea1/5f301/db-connection.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 15.294117647058824%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='db connection' title='' src='/static/abbf900364aa2578b7c0669800556ea1/ca1dc/db-connection.png' srcset='/static/abbf900364aa2578b7c0669800556ea1/e7570/db-connection.png 170w,\n/static/abbf900364aa2578b7c0669800556ea1/f46e7/db-connection.png 340w,\n/static/abbf900364aa2578b7c0669800556ea1/ca1dc/db-connection.png 680w,\n/static/abbf900364aa2578b7c0669800556ea1/02d09/db-connection.png 1020w,\n/static/abbf900364aa2578b7c0669800556ea1/5f301/db-connection.png 1146w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"데이터-삽입\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%82%BD%EC%9E%85\" aria-label=\"데이터 삽입 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>데이터 삽입</h3>\n<p>필요한 DB와 테이블을 생성해주고, 데이터를 추가한다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/f1381e48bf00443f29cc09717efec43b/e584c/db.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 13.529411764705882%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='db' title='' src='/static/f1381e48bf00443f29cc09717efec43b/ca1dc/db.png' srcset='/static/f1381e48bf00443f29cc09717efec43b/e7570/db.png 170w,\n/static/f1381e48bf00443f29cc09717efec43b/f46e7/db.png 340w,\n/static/f1381e48bf00443f29cc09717efec43b/ca1dc/db.png 680w,\n/static/f1381e48bf00443f29cc09717efec43b/02d09/db.png 1020w,\n/static/f1381e48bf00443f29cc09717efec43b/9d567/db.png 1360w,\n/static/f1381e48bf00443f29cc09717efec43b/e584c/db.png 2070w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"배포-자동화\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B0%B0%ED%8F%AC-%EC%9E%90%EB%8F%99%ED%99%94\" aria-label=\"배포 자동화 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>배포 자동화</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Github-Actions-스크립트-추가\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Github-Actions-%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%BD%ED%8A%B8-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80\" aria-label=\"Github Actions 스크립트 추가 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Github Actions 스크립트 추가</h3>\n<p>이제 기존 github actions 스크립트에 docker <strong>이미지를 실행 중인 Elastic Beanstalk에 반영하는 스크립트를 추가</strong>해보자.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"workflow\"><pre class=\"language-workflow\"><code class=\"language-workflow\">name: CI/CD  \n  \non:  \n  push:  \n    branches:  \n      - master  \n  \nenv:  \n  ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ secrets.AWS_ECR_REGISTRY }}  \n  ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.AWS_PROD_ECR_REPOSITORY }}  \n  IMAGE_TAG: ${{ github.sha }}-${{ github.run_number }}  \njobs:  \n  build-and-push:  \n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest  \n  \n    steps:  \n      - name: Checkout repository  \n        uses: actions/checkout@v3  \n  \n      - name: Configure AWS CLI  \n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v2  \n        with:  \n          aws-access-key-id: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}  \n          aws-secret-access-key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}  \n          aws-region: ap-northeast-2  \n  \n      - name: Log in to Amazon ECR  \n        id: login-ecr  \n        uses: aws-actions/amazon-ecr-login@v1  \n  \n      - name: Build and Push Docker Image  \n        run: |  \n          docker build -t $ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG .  \n          docker push $ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG  \n  \n      - name: Get current time  \n        uses: 1466587594/get-current-time@v2  \n        id: current-time  \n        with:  \n          format: YYYYMMDD_HH-mm-ss  \n          utcOffset: &quot;+09:00&quot;  \n  \n      - name: Update Dockerrun.aws.json  \n        run: |  \n          sed -i &quot;s|{{ECR_REGISTRY}}|${{ env.ECR_REGISTRY }}|g&quot; environment/prod/Dockerrun.aws.json  \n          sed -i &quot;s|{{ECR_REPOSITORY}}|${{ env.ECR_REPOSITORY }}|g&quot; environment/prod/Dockerrun.aws.json  \n          sed -i &quot;s|{{IMAGE_TAG}}|${{ env.IMAGE_TAG }}|g&quot; environment/prod/Dockerrun.aws.json  \n  \n      - name: Beanstalk Deploy  \n        uses: einaregilsson/beanstalk-deploy@v22  \n        with:  \n          aws_access_key: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}  \n          aws_secret_key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}  \n          application_name: test-prod-app  \n          environment_name: Test-prod-app-env  \n          version_label: test-prod-${{steps.current-time.outputs.formattedTime}}  \n          region: ap-northeast-2  \n          deployment_package: environment/prod/Dockerrun.aws.json</code></pre></div>\n<p>Elastic Beanstalk 배포에 필요한 Dockerrun.aws.json 파일은 environment 디렉토리에 환경 별로 작성했다. </p>\n<h3 id=\"소스-코드-push\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%86%8C%EC%8A%A4-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C-push\" aria-label=\"소스 코드 push permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>소스 코드 push</h3>\n<p>이제 변경된 소스 코드를 push하면, Elastic Beanstalk에 자동으로 반영된다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 578px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/13692002e543e0a0423c0b43754f2831/8c7b4/app.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 85.29411764705883%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='app' title='' src='/static/13692002e543e0a0423c0b43754f2831/8c7b4/app.png' srcset='/static/13692002e543e0a0423c0b43754f2831/e7570/app.png 170w,\n/static/13692002e543e0a0423c0b43754f2831/f46e7/app.png 340w,\n/static/13692002e543e0a0423c0b43754f2831/8c7b4/app.png 578w' sizes='(max-width: 578px) 100vw, 578px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n샘플 앱에서 Spring Boot 애플리케이션이 정상적으로 배포된 것을 확인할 수 있다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"소스-코드-변경\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%86%8C%EC%8A%A4-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C-%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD\" aria-label=\"소스 코드 변경 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>소스 코드 변경</h3>\n<p>dto를 변경해보자.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token comment\">// MemberDto.java</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">record</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberDto</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span> id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberDto</span> <span class=\"token function\">toDto</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span> member<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemberDto</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>member<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> member<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 580px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/4112b255a6f7b2997fa36421f57efabd/12f38/changed-app.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 101.17647058823529%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='changed app' title='' src='/static/4112b255a6f7b2997fa36421f57efabd/12f38/changed-app.png' srcset='/static/4112b255a6f7b2997fa36421f57efabd/e7570/changed-app.png 170w,\n/static/4112b255a6f7b2997fa36421f57efabd/f46e7/changed-app.png 340w,\n/static/4112b255a6f7b2997fa36421f57efabd/12f38/changed-app.png 580w' sizes='(max-width: 580px) 100vw, 580px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n구축한 파이프라인에 의해 변경 사항이 정상적으로 반영된 것을 확인할 수 있다.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Elastic Beanstalk에 애플리케이션 배포, 자동화(CD)","date":"December 17, 2024","update":"December 17, 2024","tags":["aws"],"series":"Elastic Beanstalk로 Spring Boot Application CI/CD 구축"},"fields":{"slug":"/Elastic Beanstalk에 애플리케이션 배포, 자동화(CD)/","readingTime":{"minutes":4.965}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"fa698f4a-ac13-5912-83dc-f1e2e4141ab2","fields":{"slug":"/Elastic Beanstalk이란 무엇일까?/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Elastic Beanstalk이란 무엇일까?"}}},{"node":{"id":"c6ece453-4a6b-5c41-800d-aa6e88b6490f","fields":{"slug":"/인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드"}}